{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788328056753555001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"pearly-basic-honeyeater","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"9be190617516638fc3dda1ccfc5051a550ac60e85425f71f7b2241090ad1f0b9","event_uuid":"9b4d29a9-de90-4d9e-a282-33381b496471","position":{"commit_sha":"eafcfd0f186fc861beaa644fdebb1d4c3fa8e35b","position":"1788313649310830001-9b4d29a9-de90-4d9e-a282-33381b496471"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"2d238a4c9476409677e27ad11257df2ce18f48d42a497277879fc69401e53a01","event_uuid":"ec3c1441-8aac-4f53-867c-2db25623ada1","position":{"commit_sha":"5e403ad9bb9749e361dc7ae8e2fcd7857b765000","position":"1788313657834130001-ec3c1441-8aac-4f53-867c-2db25623ada1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788313649310830001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThe CLI and MCP accept reviewer selection at `src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/llm.py:56-72` and `src/rebar/_mcp_llm.py:93-124`, but `src/rebar/llm/code_review/shim.py:117-174` discards it. Callers can pay for the same gate-run while believing they selected its reviewers.\n\n## Approach\n\nImmediately remove reviewer-selection input from CLI parsing, the MCP method and generated input schema, and the keyword-only Python signature. Keep gate-owned overlay selection and the result `reviewers` field. This is an intentional pre-1.0 breaking change, not a deprecation period.\n\n## Scope\n\n- code-review CLI parser and help\n- MCP method/schema and Python review-code signature\n- API/MCP baselines, docs, changelog, and ADR 0075 supersession note\n- contract tests\n\nCascade flag: true. Recensus static, dynamic, documentation, fixture, and monkeypatch callers.\n\n## Testing\n\nExercise CLI parsing, MCP schema validation, Python signature rejection, and the no-billable-call boundary for old invocations.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] CLI `--reviewer`, MCP `review_code.reviewers`, and Python `reviewers=` inputs are absent from their contracts.\n- [ ] Old calls fail at parsing, schema, or signature validation before a billable model call.\n- [ ] Gate-owned reviewer selection remains and result `reviewers` accurately reports reviewers that ran.\n- [ ] API/MCP baselines, docs, changelog, and ADR 0075 state the pre-1.0 breaking replacement: omit selection and inspect result reviewers.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/llm.py","reason":"remove CLI reviewer-selection input and help"},{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_llm.py","reason":"remove MCP input and generated schema field"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/shim.py","reason":"remove Python reviewer parameter"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_code_review_surface_parity.py","reason":"prove CLI/Python/MCP input contracts and result reporting"},{"path":"docs/adr/0075-four-pass-code-review.md","reason":"record supersession of retained input signature"},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","reason":"record intentional pre-1.0 breaking change"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","api","breaking-change","rp18"],"ticket_id":"3c2f-01aa-7ea1-409b","ticket_type":"story","title":"Remove caller-selected reviewer inputs from code review contracts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["9b4d29a9-de90-4d9e-a282-33381b496471","ec3c1441-8aac-4f53-867c-2db25623ada1"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788328056753555001,"uuid":"4027ceab-3d33-47bb-9116-7326231a96f0"}